Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Shared-expert gate GEMV with the SIGMOID / MUL / ADD
 after it in one mul_mat_vec_f launch: every block recomputes the one gate row
 exactly as the plain launch does and applies sigmoid_mul_add_f32's arithmetic
 to its slice. BF16 / F32 gate weights only (F16 can take a half accumulator),
 only where the dispatcher would pick mul_mat_vec_f. Bit-identical.
 GGML_CUDA_FUSE_SHEXP_GATE_SIGMOID=0 off

